    "Description": "Single-header Ogg Vorbis decoder from the stb repository. audio4cj's pure-Cangjie Vorbis kernel (src/format/vorbis*.cj) references its algorithm structure (codebooks/Huffman, floor1, residue, IMDCT) and was re-implemented in Cangjie; no stb_vorbis source code is bundled, linked or redistributed. The upstream code is offered under the Unlicense (public domain) or MIT, neither of which imposes copyleft conditions, so it is not a runtime or distribution dependency. See LICENSES.md for the full ledger."
